081.csv::390.translated_text:
Teachings carved by someone emerge—

&quot;Three—endure the enemy&#x27;s attempts 
​to shake you off.&quot;

081.csv::391.translated_text:
&quot;While clinging to an enemy in an enraged
state, when the yellow shake-off warning
appears, press &lt;ICON STG_TOUCH&gt;.&quot;

081.csv::394.translated_text:
&quot;When clinging to enraged enemies,
press &lt;ICON UI_DECIDE&gt; or &lt;ICON UI_CANCEL&gt;
when the red Struggle icon appears by
their gauge.&quot;
